@include ../../shared/squash.overtone

## Forehand to backhand volleys
@track Volleys
Forehand to backhand volleys, five minutes. In the middle, two metres from the front wall: forehand
across to your backhand, backhand back across, hitting around the service line just off centre. Let
it bounce for the first part. The last thirty seconds are your ladder check. Phase two target:
twenty volleys in one rally, without a break.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 5:00
0:00 [go]
7% Short swings. Racket up early.
20% Around the service line, just off centre.
33% Now on the volley. Lose it? Restart with a bounce.
50% Keep the rhythm. Watch the ball.
65% Now a step further back. More time, a firmer punch.
-0:30 Ladder check. Back where you started: count your best run on the volley. Target: twenty.
-0:10 Ten seconds.
---
[stop]
